  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     ALBAIK Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Title:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      ALBAIK Nutrition Calculator: Calories, Protein &amp; Macros\n     </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Description:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Check ALBAIK calories, protein, carbs and fat for chicken meals, nuggets, sandwiches, seafood, sides and sauces. Build your full meal and see nutrition totals.\n     </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.mr1bizuwvxo0\">\n<span>\n     ALBAIK Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     An ALBAIK order is often more than one menu item. Chicken or nuggets may come with fries, bread, sauces and a drink, so the nutrition of the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     complete meal\n    </span>\n<span>\n     can be very different from the main item alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     ALBAIK Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to search menu items, compare calories and macros, and add everything you plan to order to one combined meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.vl1a1okt7j8a\">\n<span>\n     Build the Meal You Actually Order\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The easiest way to understand ALBAIK calories is to calculate the order piece by piece.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start with your main item, such as a chicken meal, nuggets, sandwich or seafood option. Then add any fries, hummus, coleslaw, sauces, desserts or drinks you plan to have.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver will combine the selected items so you can see the total calories, protein, carbohydrates and fat for the meal instead of estimating each item separately.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is particularly useful when comparing a full meal with a sandwich or smaller order, because portion sizes can be very different.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.up26qsx07nzu\">\n<span>\n     Chicken Meals, Nuggets and Sandwiches Are Not Equivalent\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     ALBAIK offers several ways to order chicken, including multi-piece chicken meals, fillet nuggets, burgers, sandwiches and other chicken-based menu items.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Even when two options contain chicken, their nutrition can differ considerably because of:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6 ml-4 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base\">\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Portion size\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Breading and preparation\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Bread or buns\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Included sides\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Cheese or other toppings\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Sauces\n     </span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For that reason, it is better to compare the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     specific menu items\n    </span>\n<span>\n     above rather than assuming every chicken option has a similar calorie or protein count.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.izrzgagy4r4y\">\n<span>\n     Do Not Forget the Sauces and Sides\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A common mistake when calculating restaurant nutrition is counting the main item but leaving out the extras.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     At ALBAIK, additions such as\n    </span>\n<span>\n     garlic sauce, cocktail sauce, nugget sauce and fries\n    </span>\n<span>\n     contribute their own calories and macros to the final order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you use more than one sauce or order several sides, add each one to the meal builder. This gives you a much more realistic total than looking only at the chicken or sandwich.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.2qajmv51tlwp\">\n<span>\n     ALBAIK Also Has Seafood and Meat-Free Options\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The ALBAIK menu is not limited to fried chicken.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Depending on location and availability, the menu can include\n    </span>\n<span>\n     fish fillet items, shrimp meals and sandwiches, falafel, hummus, corn and other sides\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These foods have different combinations of protein, carbohydrates and fat, so use the category filters to compare options within the type of food you are actually considering.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.cp7qsvj1aguf\">\n<span>\n     Why ALBAIK Nutrition Can Differ by Location\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     ALBAIK operates across multiple markets, and menu availability can differ between countries and restaurants.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Recipes, portion sizes, limited-time products and available menu items can also change. A nutrition value found for one product or market should not automatically be assumed to apply to every ALBAIK location.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When possible, match the item name and portion shown in the calculator with the product available at your restaurant.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.c77dtrx5d97\">\n<span>\n     Quick ALBAIK Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How can I calculate calories in my full ALBAIK meal?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does ALBAIK have high-protein menu items?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Do ALBAIK sauces add calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are regular and spicy ALBAIK items nutritionally identical?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.u0op6ykiieay\">\n<span>\n     About the ALBAIK Nutrition Data\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver organizes available\n    </span>\n<span>\n     ALBAIK menu nutrition information\n    </span>\n<span>\n     into a searchable calculator so you can compare individual items and calculate a complete order more easily.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Restaurant nutrition values are estimates based on standard menu information. Actual portions and recipes may vary by location, preparation and menu updates.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "seoTitle": "ALBAIK Nutrition Calculator: Calories, Protein & Macros",
  "seoDescription": "Check ALBAIK calories, protein, carbs and fat for chicken meals, nuggets, sandwiches, seafood, sides and sauces. Build your full meal and see nutrition totals.",
