    {
      "q": "How can I calculate calories in my full ALBAIK meal?",
      "a": "Add your main item, sides, sauces and drink using the meal builder above. NutritionSolver combines the available nutrition values into one total."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does ALBAIK have high-protein menu items?",
      "a": "Several chicken, nugget and seafood items provide meaningful amounts of protein. Use the protein values in the calculator to compare specific menu options rather than relying only on calorie totals."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do ALBAIK sauces add calories?",
      "a": "Yes. Sauces contain their own calories and macros, so include them when calculating the nutrition of your complete order."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are regular and spicy ALBAIK items nutritionally identical?",
      "a": "Not necessarily. Recipes and ingredients can differ, so regular and spicy versions should be treated as separate menu entries whenever separate nutrition information is available."
    }
  ]
